# To review splits into three columns by how far the viewer has got with each PR: those they
# haven't reviewed, those they're part way through, and those they've approved. The fixtures
# hold no reviews of the viewer's, so every PR waits in the first.
wait settled
open lists
expect text "Mine (19)" exists
expect text "To review (13)" exists
expect text "Reviewing (0)" exists
expect text "Approved (0)" exists
expect button ~"atrium #2928" in list 2 exists
expect list count 2
expect text "Nothing here" count 2
snap review-columns
